<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .error-icon {
      color: #f44336;
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .error-details {
      background-color: #fff3f3;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border: 1px solid #ffcdd2;
    }
    .error-message {
      color: #f44336;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #2196F3;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .support-info {
      background-color: #e3f2fd;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div class="error-icon">⚠</div>
    <h2>Invoice Processing Error</h2>
  </div>

  <p>We encountered an issue while processing your invoice. Here are the details:</p>
  
  <div class="error-details">
    <div class="error-message">{{errorMessage}}</div>
    <p><strong>Invoice Number:</strong> {{invoiceNumber}}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="support-info">
    <h3>Need Help?</h3>
    <p>Our support team is ready to assist you with this issue. You can:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Contact our support team through the help center</li>
      <li>Reply to this email with any additional information</li>
      <li>Check our troubleshooting guide for common issues</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <a href="{{supportLink}}" class="button">Get Support</a>
  
  <p>We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused. Our team is working to resolve this issue as quickly as possible.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} SyntaxisAI. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 